      { "role": "assistant", "type": "message", "content": "I'd recommend Nightfall Signal — all four of you own it, it's 4-player co-op, sessions run 45-70 minutes, and nobody has finished it. Ridge Runners is a close second, but Robert has already completed it." },
      { "role": "user", "type": "message", "content": "Let's play Nightfall Signal." }
